WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.575
A bracket squared makes a square with two strips and a corner.

2
00:00:04.475 --> 00:00:09.150
x plus two, times x plus two, is a square, two strips and a corner.

3
00:00:09.954 --> 00:00:15.404
Make both numbers minus two. The strips turn red, but the corner stays positive.
